5,0,1,talk,Mio,,Hi everyone! This is going to be so exciting! I wonder who the werewolf is? Let's all try our best to find them together!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"It's a bit early to be so energetic, Mio, but I agree. We should stay observant.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Misaki. Let us maintain a calm atmosphere and observe each other's words carefully.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"I'm with you guys! I'll be looking for any clues, even the tiny ones. This is like a real mystery novel!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A mystery novel indeed, Kenji. Though I suspect the ""clues"" will be far more subtle than in fiction. Let us see who among us struggles most to maintain their composure.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, that sounds a bit scary! I'm perfectly composed, thank you very much! Does anyone have a strategy for how we should start?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"I think we should just listen for now. Since it's Day 0, we don't have any deaths to analyze, so we should focus on how everyone speaks.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a sound approach, Misaki. I believe listening to the natural flow of conversation will reveal more than forced questioning at this stage.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,I'll do my best to listen! But I can't help wondering if the werewolf is already trying to act like a villager right now!,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"That is the very essence of the game, Kenji. The werewolf must blend in perfectly, which makes the most ""helpful"" or ""enthusiastic"" participants occasionally the most suspicious.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Mio,,"Hey! Are you calling me suspicious, @Benjamin? I'm just being friendly! I bet the real werewolf is the one trying to act all mysterious and intellectual!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,Let's not jump to conclusions based on personality alone. That would be an inefficient way to find the werewolf.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,Misaki is correct. Let us avoid baseless accusations and instead focus on the consistency of our logic as the game progresses.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,I'll try to be logical too! But it's hard when everyone is so calm. I'm just going to keep chatting and see if anyone slips up!,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A fair strategy, Kenji. Sometimes the most chaotic approach can provoke a reaction from someone who is trying too hard to appear perfectly composed.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Mio,,I'll keep being chaotic then! Let's just have fun with it and see what happens tomorrow. Good luck everyone!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"Good luck to you too, Mio. I'll be waiting to see what the first night brings.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,May we all find the peace and clarity needed to reach the truth. Good night.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"Good night everyone! I'm going to sleep now, but I'll be dreaming of clues! See you tomorrow!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Sleep well, everyone. I shall spend my night contemplating the patterns of our first exchange. Until tomorrow.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,,action,Jonathan,Mio,WEREWOLF,"{""action"":""divine"",""result"":""WEREWOLF"",""valid"":true,""raw"":""Mio""}"
